"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 44 of those 75 years. In 2025 that pair came in at 5% of normal on the middle, and in 2026 so far March to April shows 9% on the middle. Grid 16010 had its driest year in 2011 at 33% of normal.</p>"}
